From: root <claude@example.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 07:26:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix(backend): ESM __dirname crash, explicit CORS
 allowlist (HTTP+Socket.io), trust proxy, tests, .env.example

---
